 "structural_change": "STW-S81e-FP c23 (COORD tile review 10-23 BAD on c21n: 36 macros 'face away', pin->reg p90 234 um, 87 % empty, logic forced into one 46-um row band by the 8.64 halo + 24.8 channels; c21q/c21r TT -148 = the band-wide 561-um duplicate broadcast). Same RTL / params / benches as c22r (LOCAL_RECORD=1, NEV 16). Geometry from content: each event lane = abutted N-S bank of its 5 SRAMs (pins only on W / E, N / S bare), 2 lanes per column, 8 columns alternating R0 / MY so write faces share one write channel (25.92 um) and read faces open into the lane-logic channels (28.08 um); central 86.4-um spine under the unchanged N / S pin windows holds record / select / cfg, the pin flops and the gap / retire bank. Halo 2.16 (was 8.64). Outline 457.91999999999996 x 259.2 (was 561.6 x 388.8, -46 % area); widest logic span 457.91999999999996 um.",
